title: The question before deleting shows what is about to go: a picture, a video, code, what a folder holds
folders: media
expect-log: script: Answer

wait 3500
delete img/checks.png
wait 1200
mark picture
wait 500
answer Cancel
wait 400
delete video/clip.mp4
wait 2500
mark video
wait 500
answer Cancel
wait 600
mark after-video
wait 500
delete src/lib.rs
wait 600
mark code
wait 500
answer Cancel
wait 400
delete img
wait 600
mark folder
wait 500
answer Cancel
wait 400
quit
